senses.gloss:
Priyaṃkara,
(1) n. of a Bodhisattva: Śikṣ 〔168.4 f.〕 (quoted from Upāyakauśalya-sūtra);
(2) n. of a king: Śikṣ 〔255.11〕 (quoted from Pitṛputrasamāgama);
(3) = Pali Piyaṃkara (see DPPN), n. of a yakṣa-child: Mmk 〔44.1〕 (here associated with. and apparently regarded as the son of, Hārītī).

Priyadarśana,
(1) n. of a cakravartin: Mv 〔i.114.12〕;
(2) n. of a kalpa: SP 〔431.9〕; 〔457.6〕;
(3) n. of a Bodhisattva: Śikṣ 〔124.5〕 (quoted from Dharmasaṃgīti-sūtra);
(4) n. of two yakṣas: Māy 〔48, 100〕.
